    <data key="d0">MakeMyTrip: Building Next Generation SOC</data>
    <data key="d1">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=-3lnf5lzsH0</data>
    <data key="d2">MakeMyTrip's custom next-gen SOC architecture (Blitz) built on Apache Metron, EMR, S3, Athena, and AWS WAF, handling 5000 events/sec and 250M events/day.</data>
